---
id: journey_strange_readings
title: Anomalous Readings
tags: [mystery, prior]
context: journey
weight: 8
cooldown: 6
requires:
  shipTags: [sensor]
---

=== intro

The sensors are picking up something that shouldn't exist—readings that don't match any known phenomenon. Gravity fluctuations. Radiation spectra that physics says is impossible. A point in space that seems to... fold.

The Prior tech on the ship is reacting. Instruments calibrated to their artifacts are going haywire.

* [Investigate cautiously]
  ~ fuel -= 3
  ~ flag anomaly_investigated
  ~ chronicle "Anomaly Encountered"
    Investigated an anomalous phenomenon. The readings didn't make sense before. They make less sense now.
  -> END

* [Full sensor sweep, then leave]
  ~ flag anomaly_logged
  ~ chronicle "Anomaly Logged"
    Recorded anomalous readings for later analysis. The Science Collective pays well for data like this.
  -> END

* [Get away from here]
  ~ fuel -= 2
  ~ chronicle "Anomaly Avoided"
    Detected something wrong with space itself. Burned fuel to get away fast. Some things are better left unexplored.
  -> END
